# Valid Turtle — \u0001 is a legal Turtle string escape and produces a literal
# containing U+0001, which is illegal in XML 1.0 and cannot be escaped or
# emitted in RDF/XML. Used to verify RdfXmlSerializationException → 500
# (GSP-004, GSP-010, GSP-032, GSP-022).
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:subject1 ex:predicate1 "bad\u0001char" .
